{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 616,
  "batch_count": 1662,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "c0513553da490a692523f45b5f779f99f6cb7e34",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57541cc5930c98ea080123d6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无论是披发还是盘发。\\n光是戴法不同，帽子\\n就能带来不一样的心情呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d389d46b36952e80997adc97bcc48248d281e276c303912684b808fbedc2007a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "390"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95aa623d56fd615e0b90c669",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "把帽子深深戴上，\\n或许能变成另一个自己……\\n这首歌就让人有这种感觉……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f260b3b0310083524b1eb51ffe4ede4dad3843ee5ce76c8caf352f118e8a3d8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "391"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:673bcb1e8387b00f2521b408",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "BoC'z We/n♪\\n和姐姐们去K歌\\n也会唱这首哦！超带气氛☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "da0379963d927859fceb0a75686bc480a46576e3e2ee3d1ef30a0f1174c3a0a5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "392"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0ec451b2f219c74803c0d8b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "热烈又甜蜜地融合……\\n做大福时\\n大概也是这种感觉吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c293ee1c011efc4d8222bf2a2b4edc855b7fb49992db5709b9ace9c093cdc548",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "393"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ebedd1e44b1412f54c086ac",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不要走，啊。听到这样反而\\n会很想走，但换成反过来，\\n是不是就会追上去了呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "13eaf70a161c7907130db325e5635bdadfb03a3de4c0eac44984dc6a4011aef2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "394"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ad095830f3770cd1c45c5f1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "手滑把芝麻豆腐扔出去，\\n天使就掉下来啦……\\n还好直接落嘴里了，算安全吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e6797e6b089adde49c3482f7f17d6ccc7d9f17b268218f9f63020251e546bae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "395"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95a64b24ca2c18ca71b91321",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "即使是单色的世界，\\n最闪耀的……\\n是谁呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d41c46b3361ca5b23924061d83de4da7d6e60a7de4a946e9c3d984c2ee18dd74",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "396"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19df762754d440c8bd839ca8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从曲风中能感受到\\n诉说的情感。这歌词\\n也让人想细细品味。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15706ca0246fc7c88d8ec873278a49c0055e9c276edbd2fc45d4e41c61003ab5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "397"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77990af8e3289c0d2f8ee75a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "消逝的回忆确实存在。\\n但无论多么短暂，\\n都不会变成没有发生过的事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8366af7aa946e15b89058e8000f124af5f037f1143edcf6ce6af6af861cd3294",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "398"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66c512570b9ada7965e07a36",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "memoire……是记忆的意思吧？\\n如果要留下记忆，\\n当然要尽量都是快乐的才好呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4c4f7dedae15617babf80dab9684aafc055b6e817940d28834ec334e0f99c25",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "399"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:947bc11ec827cdf0fb122cfb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊，这首歌……如果我说它不太好唱\\n让人很伤脑筋的话\\n气槽会陪我上课吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a74cc6e9cf6b28120c77fec3a4c8a32b87ba2c3a0693cc98735bd77771001d77",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65750933ab1e8b405ed897ca",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "本能与本能彼此冲击的\\n大乱斗即将开、幕～！\\n就让神鹰来敲响擂台的钟声吧～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b90c5ffc7d4d1253712feca5849937e5b4db9320ab404a014d25ade09924528",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "40"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97ef43c159b6c870766a64f9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这首歌真有速度感，\\n太棒了！从头到尾，\\n都让人停不下来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "293d465b52aece5b516936b598d52cbb33121e294a90b37dc8b828d9226cd362",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "400"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72131bce6725bc07f35ad41c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当快坚持不下、脚步要停时，\\n只要听到这首歌，\\n就仿佛又能继续奔跑了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce3ce3ed5ac4be9c7233ad87472168f15164b3bf86942c1ba77f8bc333b908bb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "401"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56cb128c66b38a5eb7591eaa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "小时候，父亲送我的帽子\\n成了我的宝物。每次听到这首歌，\\n总会让我想起那些回忆。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1be1d364bb6e6c7e33fe82de438abcb691e0da31b1af61c84d16f8aa43071dc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "402"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a0c3e6bc34c6023152be7b2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "戏剧性的曲风让人心动。\\n我也想要登上更高的地方，\\n想要闪耀——",
      "source_fingerprint": "20079ae76be33896b4cbb07328108f311d4512a3b8fcab4225902e45acaa4bfe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "403"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:725f45f9edfba24717c543a3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有收录情歌吗？\\n要是找到了，\\n一起合唱吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c716e41d233b79a3eee5d465f33ab4f2939e752ca718a9c543177bd441f51f6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "404"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0088737291cc09e468079a43",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这首歌，是“爱”哦。\\n对帽子的“爱”，对伙伴的“爱”。\\n唱出来，一定会更紧密相连。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd09fcb494f01df411215db967b91107dcadfeb638b18e39cc09f78cff98eba7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "405"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3ebe4f65541371c36f6cea4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "歌词里读得出的时代背景、\\n曲风反映的时代潮流……\\n总会不自觉被这些吸引……",
      "source_fingerprint": "937eeef91159e57d66efebe4711c342acb4b1f0c7d2f9bd54846055ffebfea2c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "406"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddb273fd323bf281ce3f4046",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你在KTV的必点曲目是～？\\n……啊。可能太老了我不认识，\\n但我马上就能记住的！因为我是天才嘛♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8fed4fd540f77273ef95aff91a2ca29c3bf3f8422e6b99efe65288a38c7e007",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "407"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9af262fe94d71ac56c531289",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "音乐能让人平静下来呢。\\n甚至能平息潜藏在心底的，暗影……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbbd125f59e7d653cca69c20a8b3b8c8e84da9ca5cd693ae50977fad419b9ba3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "408"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9fb01ab309eddf3625c0543",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "鸣响的是胜者的旋律。\\n待到老夫夺得天下之时，\\n定要让这旋律传遍世间！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6521c6bbf26be5319fcc81c035a012f52901c2af791aad4c9443c57422916e2f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "409"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5672a9ac9332b63b0ab07cde",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "唔唔唔，传奇……\\n也就是小神鹰传说对吧！\\n春、夏、秋、冬、神鹰我最强～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd9d917ef3f07801e18c360e187ab13e43bf86182ca4669a11082114735bdd58",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "41"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c410ca18fc4389c7aa12002",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正义，就是不断前进的意志！\\n本官向上攀登的这个顶点，\\n正是作为模范觉悟的证明！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd136e093378f6ce994f985173755c7a3409e40f8b7661435bb04d833913d8f2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "410"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41706e2a76be931bd3da1275",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最快的我，将超越一切。\\n……听了这首歌就能传达出去了吧，\\n英里是最强的！是最棒的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "94f526b8c5a62d4c54e1d4c9d13a733bb30599c528447d42f76d5c3ca3a98e01",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "411"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9eefb30cfcc86fa7ee7e723",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "华丽地、高傲地，以女王之姿。\\n为了终有一日能展现的那一天，\\n我会磨砺自己，为荣光之刻做准备的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbc7aaedb144c8bec324a4156be4e310937e75bff2ea858bbab1ef6d24f3480c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "412"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6aa4979cda5c8a20b5bdd454",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你不觉得这是一首充满“爱”的曲子吗？\\n我想用这首曲子，\\n给社群成员的成员们回馈满满的心动♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd975971625cbb4ae1e6443f1bf926e62a9f297d25d6909a30366b84c010bf4e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "413"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12b0d14dc8f8a50bc3cdc24a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这旋律所诉说的，是荣光的记录。\\n无论跨越多少星霜岁月，胜者的名字\\n都将伴随着歌曲被传颂下去吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b06bf9e2760810986d63c0f8d0ea7733b7127bc640759a7f66b18aaf236a5141",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "414"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cee3a180fe61108c84bf6768",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "只要交给天才潘多拉酱，\\n就算是GⅠ赛也是小菜一碟啦！\\n我会让你心动不已的，敬请期待吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a442f8fb7a11c127c46fa77dd3113fb55cd02d823429a3e49b710eff4ad087b9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "415"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8409a24fed9af12a2eb88ee",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想要为了那位而盛放。\\n……这种说出来会显得狂妄的\\n愿望，如果是寄托在这首歌里的话……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f42b406186fc6dc1e8ffc88fb7fc7d8e3f99338c2bbc7e5cf2043d6917ff5911",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "416"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54252de8f8546e6cb4ff1e16",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在打工的地方搬运重物时，\\n只要唱起这首歌就会涌出力量！\\n呵呵，还在周围流行起来了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3acf3eff89393652dab56b4f8eef7c11f90b9fb088aadbb22e721c706e296589",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "417"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0ddc4f15f02d91f4fbd155d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这歌词意外地很深刻呢。\\n像是保持本真才是最棒的、之类的。\\n……应该有不少人会被触动吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0b07cc378a38d285fd3d142daf9d067735f942c9603bcfb70ef2356d292c1e6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "418"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26154e1cb531e96db8d3df16",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "磨磨蹭蹭地汗流浃背，什么的！\\n这还真是被将了一军啊！\\n拿去吧，给你一张坐垫～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e87f78f06d16c240dfd34674b5e8c1585ebb73859ab43f91f59b855f9d027e53",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "419"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e5c37177fd95cc7f2e5202f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "音乐、鉴赏、大欢唱！\\n与神鹰我一起嗨起来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "db704d39ffd5e02e95ca09f42b26e51c4f3963aff67f1f8cc518a4e7faba6da3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "42"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9532afd8b6229a55c756634f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "要是用这首歌把全身锻炼得肌肉紧实，\\n说不定就能和丸善小姐抗衡了！？\\n麻烦再播放一遍！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa73934b58b8b907045b3197dad66e13f9626a8f32d12ee46d4bb999250aa68d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "420"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:469a53e82d69ac7d315f7697",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "来，训练员也一起来吧！\\n速度！力量！耐力！！\\n我们要把每个角落都锻炼到哦！来吧，来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92109486146860a62dc7c539123d2d364ac6fcc9df3aba88b09844b0dac48c50",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "421"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a608b4d469dc7c71c1f6684",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这是推荐给潘多拉小姐的曲子！\\n她超级喜欢……\\n我们有时还会一起唱呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "974101f436e00e2c4721b037373bcbc575e51107c2408542b69e65dde008316d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "422"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:931f96b740f44c8aa82cddf8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "唱了这首歌的话，看世界的方式\\n就会改变的哦☆感觉视野变宽广了～？\\n嗯～我也去问问小杏吧♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc6320eedf5e843c663d49e435729cb225d19313ada6b802291ee2c3a74461a4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "423"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c855f1870f84ecd8115d59cc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喜欢吗？\\n觉得怎么样？看着机伶的眼睛\\n把你所想的直接说出来嘛☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "349e964154be4cbccd04ee1334c305040765b9ce439711573e4a811dffb6fd19",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "424"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a01bcb77c6b608a09fdb40f7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊啊……如此耀眼的曲子……。\\n发自内心地，\\n甚至让人感到焦急的程度……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3269d4dd5b98c1c47496c206a4471fd96f3c20cd7d6d1d98353077dd6be7b77",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "425"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1857578cd4e28c5fdc72a628",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "和勇心酱一起想了姿势哦♡\\n全方位无死角可爱简直太无敌啦～♡\\n所·以……live也要来看看哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb06c17d6f3955682cfcfdc74129d2eb20f68950372a54ff67ca981dae913aa4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "426"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24facedc37207eb48de3c381",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在直播里唱这首歌的时候，大家都会发\\n特定的弹幕哦！你也\\n来“啾啾♡”地试一下吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d66a1e6676c22a2eea8ee3bb20869082c04e2794a15186642adbd44296b5d3c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "427"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37181d749674d03cddc586a9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "收到了高尚小姐写满听后感\\n的信……！里面写了好多好多\\n夸奖的话……真是感慨万千！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15d3d3b6ec5f1307fb0787e7f281b56b7ec1398759d6f8388b01496ca0a52380",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "428"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3741f54c3086c6dc0746fb8e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "“打倒，不可能”！\\n……真是句绝佳的话语呢。\\n总有一天我会将其体现出来的，绝对！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ace9268c44bda49926829a21e9562518104ff826e2780f0bc139e123b7ce227",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "429"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8448a28ed1f65c7b0e72c92",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我虽走在充满苦难的这条路上！\\n但王座已注定为我所属！\\n天啊！这股强悍与美丽真是重罪！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9194330925d4ef92c8602143ff6f2da193657acec029d98baef6dbd640eabc60",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "43"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f4a36a20d199b665d28cc87",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这首曲子，在KTV唱的时候可是会引起\\n抢麦克风的战争的……嘛，\\n只要我咳两声就能镇住场子就是了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b498dc302a4889807dc44533ec81a220b3f765d75a7a9ddf6e81ae533d9b6fc5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "430"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d518f98ec297ffe8cee29dd8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听着这首曲子，我就会想起来。\\n那个耀眼、清澈……令人心情愉悦的。\\n那样的……某一天的早晨。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6506dd85ae903a5b05db34c036fd4a0a9be4b5a21b4f5c00b55039f477db9645",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "431"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f54b8f836d5afa055b788bd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "被指引着来到了这里……。\\n现在，我也还在追寻着哦。\\n追寻着那“黄金的光辉”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d0616b6b265ab57959f16e36ccf8d99dc5edf474130b92b250ca7281d784a17",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "432"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80c21a4be0b57df05594cda0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "成就什么，留下什么……这是一首能让人\\n学到这份重要的好曲子！这首曲子，\\n必须也推荐给孩子们才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "142a7ad33af872a0782b4cbf8054679af425d5175391974d43941f5c29ae0583",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "433"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9becfe40228539994c1c2e9f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "随着时间的推移，万物虽会生锈腐朽，\\n但胜利的伟业在永远的时间里，\\n会持续闪耀着黄金的光辉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b145f39d656adcf229a84f2be9a86ef5f14d9a698af50f1b8de4dd6f1d6e32e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "434"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:000717c0b78a5c670027df6e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "果然还是得听朋克和摇滚吧！\\n能让人嗨到爆才算是好音乐嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "139aa64ff55e11ce4c35fd4755895b5b78ae484af161851d07c078c99debf419",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "435"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03678f3c7f465581d00a2b7d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "爷爷在工作结束后，\\n也经常听音乐来着……\\n听那种舒缓的，能让人放松的曲子……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ebe5369cb5aa6375acaf21a133f943cc2f2c3305b255f678e0b90ee216c04d7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "436"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f02d7b70f2848a6dfe409f0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有各种各样的曲子呢～……哦，\\n这首曲子宝穴酱她们好像会喜欢！\\n去告诉她们吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d64cd0595c8bd827334994546dd814cfdd52c10466d5efe163fd1a46deb0b07f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "437"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1870382b289ed2f38919d170",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有各种各样的歌呢～。\\n不知道有没有我们一起\\nlive时唱过的曲子呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "11a03996fed6cda39c5f32292771d36c2277bdadf0c23ba58be69557b36fc372",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "438"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d3504e5472f1f1c32f1d6e9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一首好歌，能把记忆深处的海洋\\n恰到好处地搅动起来。\\n你是不是，也浮现出了什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d6db408793f7efa1fbe8ce8ac7a1d65826ba082666ccaf1d12ff0d13e99c062",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "439"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27b9f2a121edb3930bd38f7d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛马娘的历史产生了变动。\\n就在我以此曲歌舞之日，\\n世界便迎来了黎明！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebbe14b6a4ffd536cb54cb4a59ca47d07a90c3deb97b970823ec23f46f9d74d3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "44"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35083b523250431ef120b6fd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请问这里面，有没有漫画改编的\\n动画歌曲之类的？就是那种能让\\n创作欲望猛烈涌现出来的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "87cec5c6001c934ac57f6c343f69e8668d21d5304958fbcc189c25253a8e25d2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "440"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e304b22614e151cad4359e4b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好的音乐会永远流传下去——\\n我也想成为，一直留在大家记忆里的\\n“最强”赛马娘呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b1d15c35a9131dbcbe4a2373ce4f904e0f4ce0560791765c586a733ef3de581",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "441"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e439dc164b0754deba0b0758",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我经常听音乐呢。\\n毕竟在为了赛事\\n调整心情的时候再合适不过了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8b5c54faa185d5bff7132e39dc4e3889fb2f0b04bf9e1a49be9e023ee5f2eab",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "442"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3968b7122921c37e9a107393",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "什么『进化论』我才不管呢！\\n我可不选别人走过的路。\\n我要贯彻到底，只属于我自己的进化！",
      "source_fingerprint": "19e3d594a610ec8540f099992210868abbdadc9e8d00206ba8d93de04e2e13a0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "443"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b7be5cf756e720dc45a0f48",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一心一意地笔直向前，不断磨砺。\\n这正是职人应有的姿态呢。\\n……我也，一定会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "279877447faa92d91f370d6a81b7e8696db41d977b17df770838b32ed980a852",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "444"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8d086eeddf5be6119445172",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好几次都被歌词鼓励了呢。\\n即使被高墙阻挡，也绝对不会放弃。\\n因为我也想在这里，闪闪发光！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b5cca228f59d03583636d45bca0f96965d6cb6d6b5f39f4aa92ada9715423e4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "445"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f95bfe098fba634e6aac5965",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "被憧憬所引导，我也是一样的。\\n梦中见到的景色，以及那前方的未来。\\n……好想，二人一起去看看啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccc4c852962ee2586772dee130b396d8afa16451b4307412b915a7a8d4211ac1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "446"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:990a6cdc5e42650bd7a143ae",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这是在火焰中，由强者编织而成的歌。\\n演奏着，迈步着，然后前往『新天地』。\\n……接下来该去向哪里呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "59439cdd7074f7b53ef2cbecf75c2bdfeffd41ad392928f756ab03195e613f19",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "447"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f25ce7256eeec0b9fc52edda",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "与同世代的劲敌，擦出火花的\\n激烈碰撞……咕～，这是最棒的热血展开！\\n我也要，把它描绘出来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bad636eef636cefaaaa39f7d5aca12e96ad33c760f8eefc5ccde52b9661a3d7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "448"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77ac33ee5b06a4f9602586f1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如果是这首纯朴又充满偶像风格的曲子，\\n王道可爱的莱斯酱最合适不过了！\\n自己的光辉，就必须要自己来创造哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53529c2fa6f36d2bc4864554ad6b7685a66c1e6021fa914ae6296c86ff4431f2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "449"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ebf46093773cd16cb02221d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊～彷佛现在仍能听见……\\n那赞颂霸王的合奏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a80cfdfa7feccc4507f44c176703dfa21777d98591f48f5ec8a2b5f9847c687c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "45"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53c2ca25685cf67da2647a03",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "点缀着鲜艳历史的三后冠。\\n我是绝对不会输给过去的杰出人物的！\\n超越一切、取得胜利的会是我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f31e1451d32ae12d32696a1a14ba9d7b6c34d8812a6b78ccc4ac1d7d98105443",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "450"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c29e57831c709871d40dff9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎呀～这简直就是，洗完澡后\\n想一手拿着咖啡牛奶唱的歌。\\n训练酱，要不要来合唱一曲？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5097e052cd4d7457e5d9455c18e42f60eadba6bf0d67be6dd5bb1db3649fffaa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "451"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1e282e13dc6f407a0537cf3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "摇摇晃晃，轻飘飘的……呵呵呵。\\n总觉得是一首让人心里暖洋洋\\n的歌呢……哈呼呼♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "423f0354fa9ab4c8881186b9f90ca73b409e80fe613c9359a481aa6e82ebb6a4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "452"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f3abc23fb0484bc62a87c06",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "充满亲切感的曲调和歌词……\\n和意气相投的伙伴一起欢唱欢笑……\\n真是招揽客人去温泉的最佳曲目呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "38977cc804edfce8bb99f4eeb807a50680a903e056f01cafac639d42a33c9080",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "453"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fdb033497ed2376beab62c3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不要听我的歌听到头晕脑胀啦，你\\n快打起节拍来！因为我会让你嗨到\\n身体的最深处都热起来哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59c2ab98719e5136410a20aad2a7224c5cb3b8108d858316f1730f910f6ee564",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "454"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc0cf196aae59709ad564103",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "注入了心意的磁带……我虽然没有录音\\n功能，但是可以留在『记忆』里。\\n那段在温泉热气中的欢乐时光",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e0c5561dade698e54527c96be1930a3dba428b9f3b1bfe4323ffb08d183929e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "455"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d763db2168b01099ca5e14e1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "回到宿舍，就有快驹酱的\\n「欢迎回来」在等着……这种\\n平平淡淡的感觉，果然很好呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "c56ea0be32b8c0db650bd167f2f24a53bfb382ae94d5e71126b71f9caf03275f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "456"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8be20ab727a1ed5cb40f6fc5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "下次，也想和医院的孩子们一起唱啊\\n随着跳跃的节奏，合着声音……。\\n愿大家的每一天，也能变得温暖。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e15d5e8afceb42b795a815ac4565a8971c2e1d63fca6e5ddad9a74d134a2100",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "457"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8215a20dc6a2fc0aefffb69e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一个人做不到的事情，如果是和重要\\n的人一起……呵呵。希望能如歌词所写\\n那样，铭记于心地生活下去呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bcb158f81fec638c2a513205f45c8924fc1ffc6e42fef16efb436457dad716b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "458"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57d9230b842fc90e157cbdee",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我最喜欢这首曲子了！每个人都\\n有出场的机会，说『我们』……\\n就好像大家都能成为主角一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6878d47be1a4400ed36a6ad808a344f3e75d1f43b1c57030f43f36af471cc298",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "459"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:554541ad6202a2f866760d2b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "跟称号无关。\\n我只是想一直赢下去……\\n今后……也都一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ecdb682ddc71bf699b406ece92fecbab76a69bed95f6e34f2c28a2073527afe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "46"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e13ddcb5fa2987c2da3ecf3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "很美的曲子，却带着一抹寂寞。\\n不要说什么「再见」，而是马上\\n相见吧，好啦你好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "591f82d6956118cdcf2ac6ed8e03cfd3837c201930d9706172b58209b199855b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "460"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84ffe273d68cac906976874f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听着这首曲子就能看到了。\\n每当回首一路奔跑而来的日子，\\n总会在那里……看到玉藻的身影。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ee7682a69ad124dfe5eee184c70899018c40d6619e15980f843b4d02509831d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "461"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
